    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49542" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Tūtēlīna</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Tūtīlīna</span></b> , ae,
			f.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				guardian deity</i>, <i>tutelar goddess.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> Of Rome, <i><span class="en">Varr. L. L. 5, § 163</span></i>
