        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			Of corn, <i><span class="en">Tert. Spect. 8</span></i>;
					<i><span class="en">Macr. S. 1, 16</span></i>; Aug. Civ. Dei,
			4, 8; cf. <i><span class="en">Plin. 18, 1, 3, § 8</span></i>; v.
			Tutanus.</div>
